; `cond` was removed (AX2004): the keyword stays reserved so old
; source gets migration advice instead of an application of an
; undefined variable. The variadic `if` covers it -
; `(if t1 b1 t2 b2 ... els)` is the nested chain - and `axiom explain
; AX2004` carries the rewrite, including the one deliberate semantic
; change (a variadic `if` joins each pair where `cond` never joined
; clause bodies).
(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  (cond ((== 1 1) 1) (else 0)))
